  "legalLastUpdated": "Last updated: October 2026",
  "privacyBody": "تقويم ومواقيت is a personal companion for prayer times, Qibla, weather, and the Hijri and Gregorian calendars. We do not create accounts, and we do not run a user-data cloud for this app.",
  "privacyDeviceTitle": "Data on your device",
  "privacyDeviceBody": "Your choices — city, language, calculation method, Adhan mosque, temperature unit, calendar view, and alert preferences — are saved locally on the device so they remain after you close the app. These settings are not uploaded to our servers.",
  "privacyLocationTitle": "Location",
  "privacyLocationBody": "If you allow location access, coordinates are used on the device to calculate prayer times and Qibla, and to request weather for your area. You can turn GPS off and pick a city manually at any time.",
  "privacyWeatherTitle": "Weather",
  "privacyWeatherBody": "Current conditions and the forecast are requested from the Open-Meteo weather service using coordinates or the selected city. A short cache is kept on the device to limit repeat requests.",
  "privacyNotificationsTitle": "Notifications and Adhan",
  "privacyNotificationsBody": "Prayer and occasion reminders are scheduled locally through the device notification system. Adhan audio plays on your device. We do not send marketing messages.",
  "privacyShareTitle": "Sharing and retention",
  "privacyShareBody": "We do not sell your data. We do not require your name, email, or phone number to use the app. Local settings remain until you clear the app data or uninstall it.",
  "termsBody": "By using تقويم ومواقيت you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please stop using the app.",
  "termsServiceTitle": "What the app provides",
  "termsServiceBody": "The app displays prayer times, Qibla, weather, a Hijri and Gregorian calendar, and Islamic and national occasions. Some features need the permissions you grant, and weather needs a network connection.",
  "termsPrayerTitle": "Prayer times",
  "termsPrayerBody": "Times are calculated on the device, by default according to the Umm Al-Qura method. You may choose another calculation method. Displayed times help you organize the day; they are not a fatwa or an official moon-sighting announcement.",
  "termsAccuracyTitle": "Accuracy",
  "termsAccuracyBody": "Qibla, weather, and calendar dates may differ because of device sensors, network delays, or later official announcements. Confirm important worship times and holidays from official sources when needed.",
  "termsUseTitle": "Your responsibilities",
  "termsUseBody": "Use the app lawfully. Do not rely on it as the sole source for legal or religious rulings. Keep location and notification permissions under your control.",
  "termsLiabilityTitle": "Limitation of liability",
  "termsLiabilityBody": "The app is provided as is. We are not liable for delays, calculation differences, missed reminders, or decisions based on the information shown.",
  "termsChangesTitle": "Changes",
  "termsChangesBody": "These terms and the privacy policy may be updated inside the app. Continued use after an update means you accept the latest version.",
  "aboutBody": "Prayer times using Umm Al-Qura, Qibla, weather, Hijri and Gregorian calendars, and Adhan from Masjid al-Haram and Al-Masjid an-Nabawi. Location stays on your device for prayer times, Qibla, and weather.",
